---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GuideList from '../components/GuideList.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import light from '../assets/studies/light.svg';
import still from '../assets/studies/still.svg';
---
<Base><section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A journal of instant photography</p><h1>把此刻，<br/>留在相纸上。</h1><p class="lead">学习宝丽来、发现值得关注的创作者，在一张张即时照片里收藏自己的日常。</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="primary" href="/learn/">从第一张照片开始</a><a class="text-link" href="/gallery/">浏览照片墙 →</a></div></div><div><div class="hero-art"><figure class="print back"><Image src={still} alt="抽象静物配色示意" width={600} height={600}/></figure><figure class="print"><Image src={light} alt="抽象光影配色示意" width={600} height={600}/><figcaption>01 / Light study</figcaption></figure></div><p class="note mt-3">原创视觉示意 · 非真实宝丽来照片</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Learn</p><h2>从这里开始学习</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/learn/">所有教程 →</a></div><GuideList/></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Discover</p><h2>值得关注的人</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/creators/">创作者名录 →</a></div><div class="empty"><h3>慢慢整理，认真推荐。</h3><p>只收录经过站主亲自确认的摄影创作者。名录等待第一批精选名单。</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Collect</p><h2>一面照片墙</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/gallery/">进入展馆 →</a></div><p class="lead">按主题收藏照片与拍摄笔记。第一批真实照片等待站主提供。</p><a class="primary mt-6" href="/gallery/">查看展览布局</a></section></Base>

